### Post-authentication eligibility gate demo
### Flow Manager calls only prepare-authorization after PSU authentication.
### Core selects POLICY checks by tenant + consentType + optional clientId + requiredScopes.

### 1. Consent type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/consent-types
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "code": "ELIGIBILITY_DEMO",
  "displayName": "Eligibility Demo",
  "description": "Demo post-authentication eligibility gate",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "contentSchema": {},
  "active": true
}

### 2. Registration policy
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/policies/consent-types
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "consentType": "ELIGIBILITY_DEMO",
  "evidencePolicy": "NOT_REQUIRED",
  "maxValidityDays": 365,
  "requireSubject": true,
  "allowTrustedAutoAuthorization": false,
  "allowedChannels": ["WEB", "MOBILE"]
}

### 3. Mock backend returns normalized POLICY fact eligible=false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/providers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "providerCode": "MOCK_SERVICE_STATUS",
  "providerType": "MOCK",
  "adapterKey": "CONFIGURED_MOCK",
  "endpointTemplate": null,
  "httpMethod": null,
  "credentialReference": null,
  "timeoutMs": 1000,
  "configuration": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "data": {"eligible": false}
  },
  "active": true
}

### 4. Bind logical SERVICE_REGISTRATION_STATUS to the backend provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/bindings
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "dataType": "SERVICE_REGISTRATION_STATUS",
  "consentTypeCode": "ELIGIBILITY_DEMO",
  "providerCode": "MOCK_SERVICE_STATUS",
  "mappingProfileCode": null,
  "priority": 1,
  "configuration": {},
  "active": true
}

### 5. Configure post-auth check only for client tpp-eligibility and OAuth scope accounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reference/data-enrichment/requirements
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Actor-Type: {{actorType}}
X-Source-System: {{sourceSystem}}

{
  "consentTypeCode": "ELIGIBILITY_DEMO",
  "requirementCode": "service-registration",
  "resolutionPhase": "PREPARE_AUTHORIZATION",
  "clientId": "tpp-eligibility",
  "requiredScopes": ["accounts"],
  "dataType": "SERVICE_REGISTRATION_STATUS",
  "dataPurpose": "POLICY",
  "required": true,
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "freshnessSeconds": 60,
  "configuration": {
    "eligibility": {
      "field": "eligible",
      "reasonCode": "PSU_SERVICE_NOT_REGISTERED",
      "messageKey": "consent.eligibility.service_not_registered",
      "retryable": false
    }
  },
  "active": true
}

### 6. Register consent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consents
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: eligibility-register-demo-001
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: tpp-demo
X-Actor-Type: SERVICE
X-Correlation-Id: eligibility-demo-001
X-Request-Id: eligibility-register-001
X-Source-System: tpp-demo

{
  "externalRequestId": "eligibility-request-001",
  "consentType": "ELIGIBILITY_DEMO",
  "subjectId": "psu-001",
  "clientId": "tpp-eligibility",
  "purpose": "Eligibility gate demo",
  "validFrom": "2026-08-16T00:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "acquisitionChannel": "WEB",
  "captureMethod": "IN_APP_CONFIRMATION",
  "sourceSystem": "tpp-demo",
  "externalConsentId": "eligibility-external-001",
  "evidencePolicy": "NOT_REQUIRED",
  "trustedSourceAuthorization": false,
  "capturedAt": "2026-08-16T12:00:00Z",
  "capturedBy": "tpp-demo",
  "content": {
    "purposeCode": "ACCOUNT_ACCESS",
    "permissions": [{"permissionCode": "READ_ACCOUNT", "attributes": {}}],
    "resources": [],
    "constraints": [],
    "presentationSnapshot": {"title": "Eligibility demo"}
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("eligibilityConsentId", response.body.id); %}

### 7. After PSU authentication: Flow Manager enters CONSENT_PREPARING and calls Core prepare only
### Expected: HTTP 200, preparationStatus=DENIED, consent remains REGISTERED, presentationReady=false.
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/consents/{{eligibilityConsentId}}/prepare-authorization
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: eligibility-prepare-demo-001
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: flow-manager
X-Actor-Type: SERVICE
X-Correlation-Id: eligibility-demo-001
X-Source-System: flow-manager

{
  "clientId": "tpp-eligibility",
  "scopes": ["accounts", "balances"],
  "subjectRef": "psu-001"
}

### Expected body includes:
### "preparationStatus": "DENIED"
### "reasonCode": "PSU_SERVICE_NOT_REGISTERED"
### "messageKey": "consent.eligibility.service_not_registered"
### "retryable": false
### authorizationContext.status = REGISTERED
### authorizationContext.presentationReady = false
